---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Manage local pairing authority or run the loopback gateway in foreground

Usage: mxr serve [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  status   Inspect local pairing authority and any recorded hosting setup
  setup    Preview installation of an owned private HTTPS user service; --confirm applies it
  start    Preview resuming recorded hosting and local daemon recovery
  stop     Preview stopping remote hosting; --all also stops the local provider owner
  pair     Inspect or approve local pairing requests
  clients  List registered clients, or preview/revoke one
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --foreground                     Run the gateway beside the explicit local daemon
      --public-origin <PUBLIC_ORIGIN>  Exact HTTPS origin served by the private proxy; enables browser sessions
      --listen <LISTEN>                [default: 127.0.0.1:18741]
      --dry-run
      --format <FORMAT>                Structured output (json or jsonl) [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help                           Print help
